      "text": "When the caligni skulker dies, their remains dissolve into a 20-foot emanation of inky darkness before dissipating. The darkness extinguishes non-magical light sources and attempts to counteract magical light as a 1st-rank effect with a +10 counteract modifier.\n\nThe skulker's possessions are left in a pile where they died."
